{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_01796","headline":"杂曲歌辞 行路难五首 一 · 僧贯休","name":"杂曲歌辞 行路难五首 一","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"不会当时作天地，刚有多般愚与智。\n到头还用真宰心，何如上下皆清气。\n大道冥冥不知处，那堪顿得羲和辔。\n义不义兮仁不仁，拟学长生更容易。\n负心爲炉复爲火，缘木求鱼应且止。\n君不见烧金炼石古帝王，鬼火荧荧白杨里。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"僧贯休","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_01796.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_01796","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}